## Solution

The compile errors came from declaring constructors in classes that extend `System.Exception` — Apex already provides `Exception(String)` and `Exception(String, Exception)`, so those constructors conflict ("System exception constructor already defined"), which cascaded into the subclasses failing to compile. The fix is to declare the exception classes without constructors and let them inherit the built-in ones.

